		"description": "<p>1 Action, Reach: 8. Remove Soul Touched from the target and choose 1 of the following effects. If Soul Touched wasn’t removed, this does nothing:</p><ul><li><strong>Recovery.</strong> Target ally regains LVL HP. You can spend mana (up to your unlocked spell tier) to increase the healing by 5 per mana spent.</li><li><strong>Purity.</strong> Remove 2 negative (non-Wound) conditions from the target.</li></ul><hr><p><em>[A] Grants two separate Rite features — Defiance Rite: Recovery and Defiance Rite: Purity. Each checks and removes your Soul Touched on the target.</em></p><p><em>[M] Characters created before this update: delete and re-add Defiance Rites to receive them.</em></p>",
